        "headline_findings": [
          "Korea Forest Service 2026 map (released Sep 22) puts peak (its 50%-colored measure) at Seoraksan Oct 20, Juwangsan Oct 26, Jirisan Oct 27, Songnisan Oct 28, Palgongsan Oct 30, Naejangsan Nov 4, Hallasan Nov 6. Nationwide ginkgo peaks Oct 30 and maples Oct 31.",
          "Weather i 2026 (peak = 80% colored): Odaesan Oct 16, Seoraksan Oct 25, Chiaksan Oct 31, Bukhansan Nov 4, Jirisan and Gayasan Nov 5, Naejangsan Nov 11, Palgongsan Nov 12, Hallasan Nov 13. Southern mountains run 7-15 days later than normal because of a warm Sept-Oct.",
          "KMA saw the first Seoraksan foliage on Sep 28, 2026. That is normal timing and 4 days earlier than 2025. Ridges should peak Oct 15-20 and valleys Oct 20-27, so the whole trip window is prime time for Seoraksan.",
          "Best color during Oct 17-25 is in high Gangwon: Odaesan Seonjae-gil and Woljeongsa (peak about Oct 16-20, go early in the trip), then Seoraksan valleys (Biseondae, Jujeongol) Oct 19-23. Gapyeong gardens and Nami Island come at the end of the window.",
          "Seoul city (palaces, Namsan, Deoksugung, Seoul Forest), Gyeongju (Bulguksa, Tongiljeon ginkgo), Naejangsan, Gayasan, Palgongsan and Hallasan will show only early or partial color. Their peaks fall in late Oct to mid Nov.",
          "Seoul Eulalia Festival at Haneul Park runs Oct 17-23, 2026, 10:00-21:00, and is free. Silver grass will be at peak, which makes it an ideal arrival-day or evening activity.",
          "Seorak Cable Car costs 16,000 KRW round trip for adults. Tickets are sold on-site the same day only, with an assigned boarding time. Autumn weekend waits run 2-4 h or tickets sell out, so go on a weekday and buy at opening.",
          "Hwadam Botanic Garden's 2026 autumn season is Oct 23-Nov 15 (08:00-18:00). Entry is 11,000 KRW plus 5,000-9,000 KRW for the monorail, booked online only through NOL by time slot. Only Oct 23-25 of the trip overlaps.",
          "Silver grass is at peak during the trip: Mingdongsan (festival Sep 18-Nov 8; car access to Balgudeok closed), Ganwoljae/Yeongnam Alps and Jeju Saebyeol Oreum.",
          "Pink muhly (Cheomseongdae, Yangju Nari Park, Busan Daejeo) peaks late Sep to early Oct and will be fading. Nari Park closes for the season Oct 25.",
          "Unmunsa's 450-year-old ginkgo courtyard opens only about 2 days in early-mid Nov (Nov 8-9 in 2025). 2026 dates are not announced and will almost certainly fall after the trip.",
          "Weather: Seoul October normals are a 20.2 C high and 10.6 C low, with 52 mm of rain on about 5 days. Mountain mornings are near 0-5 C. Seoul sunrise and sunset run 06:40/17:53 on Oct 17 and 06:48/17:43 on Oct 25."
        ],
        "top_recommendations": [
