          "Gyeongbokgung Starlight Night Walk (경복궁 별빛야행) has foreigner-only sessions on Wed Oct 21 to Sat Oct 24 at 18:30 and 19:40; dates come from the official royal palace calendar. It is the best palace night program during the trip. The foreigner booking channel and price are unconfirmed (about KRW 60,000 in past years).",
