          "The Gwangalli drone show in Busan is free and runs every Saturday (Oct 17 and Oct 24) at 19:00 and 21:00 on the October-February schedule. The Busan Fireworks Festival is Nov 7, after the trip.",
          "The Banpo Moonlight Rainbow Fountain runs until Oct 31 (12:00, 19:30, 20:00, 20:30, 21:00). The car-free Jamsu Bridge festival under it runs Sundays Oct 18 and Oct 25.",
          "KBO 2026 schedule from Wikipedia: Semi-Playoff Oct 17-23 (KIA in Gwangju vs the LG/Doosan wild-card winner, so possibly games at Jamsil), Playoff Oct 25-31, Korean Series Nov 2-10. The Korean Series is after the trip, and postseason tickets are hard for foreigners to buy.",
          "No Korean public holidays fall in Oct 16-25. The nearest are Hangul Day Fri Oct 9 and the Oct 5 substitute holiday.",
