          "JSA/Panmunjom is still closed to general and foreign civilian tours in 2026 (suspended since July 2023). Standard DMZ tours (Imjingak, 3rd Tunnel, Dora) run Tue-Sun for about 55,000-95,000 KRW, closed Mondays.",
